                                "sense_id": "d64d0149-37b9-320f-9f92-c9d32fa9c9cc",
                                "text": "It is only here and there, by Duerer, Holbein, Carpaccio, or other such men, that we get a living bird rightly drawn;[18] but we may be greatly thankful for the unspared labor, and attentive skill, with which many illustrations of ornithology have been produced within the last seventy or eighty years."
                            },
