                                "sense_id": "d64d0149-37b9-320f-9f92-c9d32fa9c9cc",
                                "text": "Cornelia knew later, when she was older and had thought more, that the queen had instantly caught the defiant mood of her guest, and thereupon left nothing unspared to conciliate it."
                            }
                        ]
